  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the conduit automatically succeeds at any Use Magic Device checks involving their thaumically charged objects. Additionally, the conduit chooses a single esoterica that they can produce (excluding a protoarcanum); the chosen esoterica can be used any number of times per day, although its ‘daily uses’ cannot be spent when using a protoarcanum.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conduit#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
